          "note": "Topic 12.8 with the For Your Information box (PDF 274, printed 271)."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "All nuclear processes, such as nuclear reactions and nuclear decays, obey conservation laws, such as:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": true,
            "items": [
              "Conservation of energy, momentum and charge. It includes the nucleon number and the charge number (Z).",
              "Conservation of baryon number.",
              "Conservation of lepton number."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "For Your Information: hadrons and non-hadrons",
            "header": [
              "Group",
              "Members"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Hadrons: mesons",
                "pions, kaons"
              ],
              [
                "Hadrons: baryons",
                "protons, neutrons, omega, sigma and lambda particles"
              ],
              [
                "Non-hadrons: leptons",
                "electrons, muons, neutrinos"
              ],
              [
                "Non-hadrons: others",
                "photons, gravitons"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
